+# Hard wall-clock cap (seconds) on each headless resolver. A stuck claude — network
+# stall, runaway tool loop, stdin block — is killed and the conflict escalates to a
+# human, instead of wedging the driver in an unbounded wait forever.
+RESOLVE_TIMEOUT="${STACK_RESTACK_RESOLVE_TIMEOUT:-600}"
